[ DIALS: A CLOCK ROUTINE. ONCE A FRAME, READ DIALS 0, 1 AND 2 INTO THE
[ ANGLES THE VIEWER IMAGES TURN BY.  A DIAL'S FRACTION, TIMES PI, IS
[ ITS ANGLE: AN ANGLE IS A FRACTION OF PI (DSPLY P. 16).
[ START IT WITH:   CLOCK (DIALS+1, DI.EX)!
DIALS:  0
        JPSR RVCD; 0
        ARMD DIALZ
        JPSR RVCD; 1
        ARMD DIALX
        JPSR RVCD; 2
        ARMD DIALY
DI.EX:  NOOP                    [ CLOCK PUTS THE RETURN HERE
